{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321303001:1":{"text":"ガルダさん、何かお困りですか？ぼんやり温泉を眺めてるようでしたが、お湯に問題でも？","source_cn":"老板娘，你遇到什么棘手的事了吗？满满看你一直盯着温泉发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA22B088F33972495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321303002:1":{"text":"いや、違うんだ。うちの温泉は地下から湧き出たもので、泉質もいいし温度もちょうどよい。ちょっと旅館の経営について考えててね。","source_cn":"啊，不是的。白熊旅店的温泉水来源于地下，不用担心水质和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1AC41FA5B4C3F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321303003:1":{"text":"うまくいってないんですか？","source_cn":"旅店的经营状况不好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF379856E2ED70D1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321303004:1":{"text":"あははっ！これだけ観光客が増えてるのに、うまくいってないと思うかい？","source_cn":"哈哈，最近雪松镇来了这么多游客，怎么可能不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B018F26EA5E9C4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321303005:1":{"text":"それどころか、お客さんが多すぎて食材が不足してるくらいだべ。","source_cn":"刚好相反，就是因为客人太多，才导致了现在的食材短缺问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1584ECB930A0FDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl